#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1229 expect=noViolation domain=LB
#note "Boundary: HGB matches no where-clause in the Define-XML value list, so no value-level Mandatory attribute applies to its empty LBSTRESC -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#define-xml FDA-SD1229-define.xml
dataset LB
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBTESTCD type=Char
col LBSPEC   type=Char
col LBSTRESC type=Char
---
001 | HGB  | BLOOD |
001 | GLUC | SERUM | 5.5
